|-----------|---------|--------|
| Rubber Band 4.x (via rubberband-sys) | GPL-2.0-or-later | https://github.com/breakfastquay/rubberband |
| Symphonia 0.5 | MPL-2.0 | https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia |
| cpal 0.18 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/RustAudio/cpal |
| GPUI 0.2 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/zed-industries/zed |
