## Notes

- Model weights (e.g. Demucs stems) are never shipped or committed; they are downloaded on first use after the user accepts the model licence (`om-stems`)
- See docs/legal/asset-provenance.csv for asset provenance
- See docs/adr/0004-stack-rust-gpui.md for dependency decisions
- Direct dependencies only; `cargo deny check` (deny.toml) covers the full tree
